   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "forward: all-reduce\nbackward: identity\n(dL/dY1 = dL/dY2 = dL/dY)",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "forward: all-reduce\nbackward: identity\n(dL/dY1 = dL/dY2 = dL/dY)",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el0065",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 400,
   "width": 839.3000000000001,
   "height": 35.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 524684855,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 867435930,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why not split A by rows?  X A = X1 A1 + X2 A2 would have to be summed BEFORE the GeLU,\nbecause GeLU(X1 A1 + X2 A2) is not GeLU(X1 A1) + GeLU(X2 A2). The column split puts the only sync at the end.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Why not split A by rows?  X A = X1 A1 + X2 A2 would have to be summed BEFORE the GeLU,\nbecause GeLU(X1 A1 + X2 A2) is not GeLU(X1 A1) + GeLU(X2 A2). The column split puts the only sync at the end.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "el0066",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 20,
   "y": 450,
   "width": 908.6,
   "height": 17.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "index": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 657417466,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1651355327,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Per MLP block: one all-reduce forward (g), one backward (f). Attention has the same shape, so 4 all-reduces per layer.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 1,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Per MLP block: one all-reduce forward (g), one backward (f). Attention has the same shape, so 4 all-reduces per layer.",
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  }
 ],
